      </div>
      <div class="pd-feature">
        <a href="/uploads/Home.png" data-hk-lightbox>
          <img class="pd-feature-img" src="/uploads/Home.png" alt="Grovia home screen" loading="lazy" />
        </a>
        <div class="pd-feature-copy">
          <p class="pd-feature-lead">Offers without searching.</p>
          <p class="sub">Best-price promotions and recent products surface on the home screen, so a familiar basket is only a tap away.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="pd-grid">
        <div class="pd-item">
          <a href="/uploads/Categories.png" data-hk-lightbox>
            <img class="pd-img" src="/uploads/Categories.png" alt="Grovia categories screen" loading="lazy" />
