          <span class="checkout-step">Step 1 &middot; Delivery details</span>
          <p class="checkout-caption">Saved addresses reduce repeated typing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="checkout-col">
          <a href="/uploads/Checkout2.png" data-hk-lightbox>
            <img class="checkout-img" src="/uploads/Checkout2.png" alt="Grovia choose payment method screen" loading="lazy" />
          </a>
          <span class="checkout-step">Step 2 &middot; Payment method</span>
          <p class="checkout-caption">Multiple payment methods remain easy to compare.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="checkout-col">
          <a href="/uploads/Checkout3.png" data-hk-lightbox>
            <img class="checkout-img" src="/uploads/Checkout3.png" alt="Grovia confirm your order screen" loading="lazy" />
