      </div>
      <div class="acc-grid">
        <div class="acc-card">
          <h3>Readable contrast</h3>
          <p>Text, prices, and controls maintain clear separation from their backgrounds.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-card">
          <h3>Generous touch targets</h3>
          <p>Primary controls and navigation items are designed for comfortable mobile interaction.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-card">
          <h3>Visible states</h3>
          <p>Selected, active, favourite, progress, and error states are communicated visually.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-card">
          <h3>Clear language</h3>
          <p>Buttons and forms use direct labels that describe the expected action.</p>
